{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Perilous Light</i> is a Lovecraftian 2D puzzle-platformer. In the game, you play as a scarred little vampire struggling to survive in a mine ruled by the monstrous angel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s core gameplay revolve around a unique player-light interaction\u2014stay out of the deadly light, solve intricate puzzles, and manipulate environmental mechanisms to carve out your path to freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xbox controller recommended. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard and mouse supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter a freeze bug, press R to restart the current save, or restart the current level from the level selection menu.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >XBOX Controller:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk: Left Stick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: B</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag objects: A</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Reflector: Right Stick</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk: A/D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: SPACE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag Objects: CTRL+A/D</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Reflector: Arrow Keys</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Light is oppression \u2014 survive between the light and the shadow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a vampire, you joined an expedition of your kin into the fabled <i>Hollow of the Angel</i>, lured by the possibility of priceless blood crystals known as <i>Tears of the Angel</i>. Your kind's unique vision made navigating the pitch-black tunnels effortless, and soon you reached the mine\u2019s deepest layer\u2014the mineralized zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the moment the blood crystal was extracted, everything changed. The shaft collapsed, madness overtook your companions, and worst of all: the once-dark underground world is now filled with blazing light. Even a single misstep into its searing glow could mean instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must tread carefully, using every shadow for shelter, and mastering the dance between light and darkness to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/602dbe3c6b08de2f92bb67afd2085251.poster.avif?t=1756629610\" width=1024 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/602dbe3c6b08de2f92bb67afd2085251.webm?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/602dbe3c6b08de2f92bb67afd2085251.mp4?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Logic is hope \u2014 solve the puzzles and find your way out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken amidst the ruins, realizing you've been attacked and abandoned by your maddened companions. Familiar corridors have twisted beyond recognition\u2014what was once a clear path is now riddled with deadly traps and shifting mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you remain calm enough to navigate the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/0dd57aae21613e6c210ed80c366e2693.poster.avif?t=1756629610\" width=1024 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/0dd57aae21613e6c210ed80c366e2693.webm?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/0dd57aae21613e6c210ed80c366e2693.mp4?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Threat is weapon \u2014 when faced with danger, you've known how to strike back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will you do when you stand before <i>IT</i>\uff1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/9b743470b185218f046e27ca5c6a8746.poster.avif?t=1756629610\" width=1024 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/9b743470b185218f046e27ca5c6a8746.webm?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/9b743470b185218f046e27ca5c6a8746.mp4?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3926180?t=1756629610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/f02bf431ad8bf012451fb96b3887897d2a869a02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756629610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/a505040343fd3423e3df2150e4e618eac11c323a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756629610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/a505040343fd3423e3df2150e4e618eac11c323a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756629610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support"