 >But the moment the blood crystal was extracted, everything changed. The shaft collapsed, madness overtook your companions, and worst of all: the once-dark underground world is now filled with blazing light. Even a single misstep into its searing glow could mean instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must tread carefully, using every shadow for shelter, and mastering the dance between light and darkness to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/602dbe3c6b08de2f92bb67afd2085251.poster.avif?t=1756629610\" width=1024 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/602dbe3c6b08de2f92bb67afd2085251.webm?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/602dbe3c6b08de2f92bb67afd2085251.mp4?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Logic is hope \u2014 solve the puzzles and find your way out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken amidst the ruins, realizing you've been attacked and abandoned by your maddened companions. Familiar corridors have twisted beyond recognition\u2014what was once a clear path is now riddled with deadly traps and shifting mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you remain calm enough to navigate the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/0dd57aae21613e6c210ed80c366e2693.poster.avif?t=1756629610\" width=1024 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/extras/0dd57aae21613e6c210ed80c366e2693.webm?t=1756629610\" type=\"video/webm; cod