</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Maple Toast Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe level design is well-structured and full of ingenious ideas. The physics system is also impressively handled.\u201d<br>electricWei<br><br>\u201cThe camera handling really stands out\u2014honestly more polished than in many commercial games. During each puzzle or platforming sequence, the camera stays steady and focused, and when the player reaches a new puzzle, it shifts smoothly to match the new context.\u201d<br>\u72ee\u5b50\u5e7d\u7075<br><br>\u201cObjects often serve multiple functions\u2014some elements must be avoided, yet can also be cleverly used to your advantage. You can really see the thoughtfulness and experience behind the design.\u201d<br>Porridge_\u996d<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/89335dea4d7ffecb95ff437599c40f724b14a41a/ss_89335dea4d7ffecb95ff437599c40f724b14a41a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756629610","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/89335dea4d7ffecb95ff437599c40f724b14a41a/ss_89335dea4d7ffecb95ff437599c40f724b14a41a.600x338.jpg?t=1756629610"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926180/799d1f16c0a8323f5c350888e5b41f791b257b43/ss_799d1f16c0a8323f5c350888e5b41f791b257b43.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756